# Files/patterns to copy from the source worktree into a newly-created worktree.
# Applied by the post-checkout hook (.cargo-husky/hooks/post-checkout). Prefixes:
#   ~>   symlink instead of copy (for heavy dirs)
#   !    run a bash command in the new worktree

# Environment files — each worktree needs its own .env (gitignored, never committed)
**/*.env*

# Generated CA — copy so every worktree presents the same system-trusted CA
# instead of generating a fresh, untrusted one (config.rs resolves ./ca from cwd)
ca/*

# Symlink the cargo build cache so a new worktree builds incrementally
~> target

# If you ever need an isolated build dir per worktree instead of the symlink,
# comment out the target line above.
